    "flow.tlsStatus.accessibilityDescription" : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver reads of an encryption badge: the short label followed by the sentence explaining what it means for the user. First placeholder is the label, second the explanation. The label alone would not say whether it is good or bad.",
