    "settings.storage.row.accessibilityValue" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver value of a storage row, read after its label. The placeholders are how much it occupies and how many things make it up, both already formatted. A row that counts nothing — decrypted content, and the total — is described by its size alone.",
