    "timeline.footer.olderFailed" : {
      "comment" : "Shown at the bottom of a drawn list when fetching the next page failed. It never replaces the list, so it has to say both things: what did not arrive, and the gesture that retries it (the pull-to-refresh every list on iOS has).",
