    "timeline.scrub.axis.hint.filterOnly" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on the activity graph when no interval of it can be subdivided any further. It promises only what activating does here, since announcing a zoom that cannot happen offers a dead gesture. Like every hint in this language it describes the result and never gives an order.",
